        | In the latest census, around #[+value(figs(place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[0][0]], 2)[1])]
        | !{place.nameNoThe} residents said they were born in
        | #[+value(topics['cob'][cob_list_21[0][0]]['text'] )]. 
        | This represented 
        | #[+pc(  place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[0][0]]  )]
        | of the local population. 
        | The figure
        if (figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[0][0]] , 2)[1] == figs(place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[0][0]], 2)[1] )
            | has remained relatively unchanged from 2011.
        else
            | has #[+value( (place.data.cob.value['change'][cob_list_21[0][0]]>0)? 'risen':'decreased' )] from 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[0][0]] , 2)[0] )]
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[0][0]] , 2)[1] )] in 2011, which at the time represented 
            | #[+pc(  place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[0][0]] )] of !{place.name + "'s"} population.
    p 
        | #[+value(topics['cob'][cob_list_21[1][0]]['text'])]
        | #[+value(country_agg.includes(cob_list_21[1][0])?'were':'was')]
        | the next most represented,
        | with 
        | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[1][0]] , 2)[0]  )] 
        | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[1][0]] , 2)[1]  )] 
        | !{place.nameNoThe} residents reporting 
        | #[+value(country_agg.includes(cob_list_21[1][0])?'one of these countries as their country of birth':'this country of birth')]
        | (#[+pc(  place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[1][0]] )]).
        | This figure 
        if (figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[1][0]], 2)[1] == figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[1][0]], 2)[1])
            | has remained relatively unchanged from 2011.
        else
            | was #[+value( (place.data.cob.value['change'][cob_list_21[1][0]]>0)? 'up':'down' )] from 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[1][0]] , 2)[0] )]
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[1][0]] , 2)[1] )] in 2011, which at the time
            if (place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[1][0]] == place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[1][0]])
                | also
            | represented #[+pc(  place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[1][0]] )] of the population of !{place.name}.
    p 
        | The number of !{place.nameNoThe} residents born in
        | #[+value(topics['cob'][cob_list_21[2][0]]['text'])]
        if ( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[1] == figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[1] )
            | remained close to #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[1] )]
            | between the last two census 
            if (place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]] == place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]])
                | (#[+pc( place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]] )] of the local population) 
            else 
                | (from #[+pc( place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]] )] of the local population in 2011 to #[+pc( place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]] )] in 2021) 
        else
            - var diff_cob3 = place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]] - place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]]
            | #[+value((diff_cob3>0)?'rose':'fell')] from 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[0] )] 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[1] )] 
            | in 2011
            | (#[+pc( place.data.cob.perc['2011'][cob_list_21[2][0]] )] of the local population) 
            | to 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[0] )] 
            | #[+value( figs( place.data.cob.value['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]], 2)[1] )] 
            | in 2021 (#[+pc( place.data.cob.perc['2021'][cob_list_21[2][0]] )]).

